      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Firstly, select a compatible authenticator solution that supports FIDO2/U2F standards and integrates with your firm's existing systems. Next, establish a clear policy outlining hardware key usage, loss procedures, and backup protocols for all staff. Then, deploy the keys to employees, providing thorough training on enrolling, using, and managing their new security devices. Finally, systematically migrate users to the new MFA method and closely monitor the transition for any authentication issues.",
